  "publishable": true,
  "workspace_title": "ActD と未処理：核小体の転写と形",
  "registration_status": "Measurement-independent dataset record. No detection, measurement, statistics, scenario generation or publication performed for this registration.",
  "owner_adoption": {
    "date": "2026-10-25",
    "status": "approved",
    "scope": "DS6a Untreated versus ActD1; mean nucleolar 5-EU and nucleolar eccentricity"
  },
  "dataset": {
    "name": "DS6a_5EU_Pulse_RawData, U2OS Untreated and ActD1",
    "source": "https://zenodo.org/records/6643470",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.6643470",
    "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
    "license_quoted": "Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International",
    "license_metadata_verbatim": {
      "id": "cc-by-4.0"
    },
    "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
    "attribution": "Schmidt, Broder; Rohatgi, Rajat; Brandman, Onn (2022), DS6a_5EU_Pulse_RawData, Zenodo 6643470, CC BY 4.0. Three of four original channels selected; pixel values and full image extent unchanged.",
    "citation": "Schmidt HB et al. Oxaliplatin disrupts nucleolar function through biophysical disintegration. Cell Reports 41(6), 111629 (2022). doi:10.1016/j.celrep.2022.111629",
    "scope": "U2OS knock-in cells, Untreated versus ActD1 (paper Fig 5A: actinomycin D 1 µM for 1 h, followed by 1 mM 5-EU for 30 min). Full 2304 × 2304 fields; uint16 OME-TIFF; 40× NA 1.4 oil; 0.1625 µm/px. File tokens and author code support this mapping; no file-level treatment allocation sheet was found.",
    "modifications": "None to raw source TIFFs. Planned channel extraction C3/C1/C2 only, with no crop, resize, intensity rescaling, stitching or duplicated field. C0 (FITC; molecular identity unresolved between paper and code) is not used.",
    "reported_change": {
      "source": "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2022.111629",
      "figure": "5A–B",
      "comparison": "ActD 1 µM versus untreated U2OS, 1 h drug treatment followed by 30 min 5-EU pulse",
      "direction": "ActD inhibits nascent RNA transcription and makes nucleoli rounder (lower eccentricity).",
      "quantity": "Paper describes loss of nucleolar 5-EU incorporation and lower eccentricity; exact medians from Data S1 could not be retrieved. No graph-digitized effect size is supplied.",
      "scope": "Paper values are per nucleolus. Cytellect plans mean raw 5-EU over each nucleus's adopted nucleolar union and area-weighted nucleolar eccentricity per nucleus, followed by field medians and source-Rep grouping. This is not an exact reproduction of the paper's pooled-object distribution.",
      "independence": "Rep1–Rep3 are source labels. All selected filenames contain 20211201 and serial image numbers; separate culture, treatment, coverslip identity, randomization and independent experiments are not documented."
    },
    "caveats": [
      "場面の目的は、ActD による核小体の転写停止と丸くなる変化を、元画像・検出結果・測定で確かめることです。論文の主張と、このデータに対する測定結果を分けて表示します。",
      "Rep1–Rep3 は出典のラベルです。同日・連番の撮影で、別々に播種・処理した独立した実験か、同じ試料の撮影系列かは未確認です。視野18枚や核小体の数を独立実験の n としません。",
      "平均5-EUは未正規化の画素平均です。著者のFig 5B描画コードの5-EU/NPM1とは異なります。NPM1の変化も比に影響するため、平均5-EUの減少量を論文の正規化値の再現とは呼びません。",
      "核小体はNPM1で定義し、別チャンネルの5-EUを測ります。ActDによるNPM1分布の変化は領域の境界にも影響します。領域未確定・候補なし・失敗を0にせず、欠測理由と対象核数を示します。",
      "論文は核小体ごとの分布、Cytellectは核ごとの面積重み付き離心率です。大きい核小体が強く寄与するため同じ母集団の中央値ではありません。",
      "デモの数値は公開画像による例示で、研究室の画像での検出・定量の妥当性を証明しません。"
    ]
  },
